uo;s 4 grids. November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle saw 40% of normal in February to March and 153% in July to August. Grid 24426 had its driest year in 1974 at 59%, and its preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 177.5.</p>"}
